      "title": "Why Vertiv and Eaton Are the Ultimate Infrastructure Plays for the AI Boom",
      "summary": "Vertiv and Eaton are positioned as key infrastructure beneficiaries of the AI boom, providing essential power and cooling solutions for data centers. Both companies report strong backlogs ($15B+ for Vertiv, $14.5B for Eaton), robust revenue growth, and multi-year visibility. However, both stocks trade at elevated valuations with significant year-to-date gains, presenting valuation risks if AI spending slows.",
